  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5d954b490ef142448a76318fa6c3dbf9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Date2Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dateDialogue:
  - girlDialogue: "Thanks for coming out again. I\u2019ve been looking forward to
      this"
    playerChoices:
    - "Same here! You\u2019re really fun to talk to"
    - I almost forgot, haha
    - "It\u2019s been a busy week, but I made time"
    - Me too!
    choicePoints: 02000000000000000100000001000000
    girlResponses:
    - "Aww, that\u2019s sweet. I enjoy talking to you too"
    - Oh... okay
    - Aw you didn't have to, but I appreciate it!
    - I'm glad to hear your excitement!
  - girlDialogue: Do you have any fun facts about you?
    playerChoices:
    - I once broke my arm falling out of a tree
    - "I\u2019m not that interesting, honestly"
    - I can draw pretty good!
    - i have a hamster!
    choicePoints: 01000000000000000100000002000000
    girlResponses:
    - Loser! I hope it healed alright
    - Okay
    - I love to draw! You should see my Art sometime
    - I used to have a hamster! His name was Shrimp. Rest In Peace!!!
  - girlDialogue: If you had to pick between Books and Movies, what would you pick?
    playerChoices:
    - Neither really...
    - Definitely books!
    - Movies! I'm not a big reader
    - Depends on my mood
    choicePoints: 00000000020000000100000001000000
    girlResponses:
    - Ah, not into that stuff?
    - Same! Reading is one of my favorite Hobbies
    - Thats alright, it's not for everyone. But you shoudl try and read more!
    - "That\u2019s fair! I like watching movies occasionally too!"
  - girlDialogue: Speaking of Hobbies, What do you do for fun?
    playerChoices:
    - I like to go to the Gym
    - I don't do anything except play Balatro
    - I like to make music!
    - I make videogames!
    choicePoints: 01000000000000000200000001000000
    girlResponses:
    - I respect that. I dpn't go to the gym often myself
    - 'Thats Embarrassing '
    - Thats so interesting! You'll have to let me listen to some of your songs!
    - Me too! I'd love to see some of your projects sometime
  - girlDialogue: This is a werid question, but what does inside of your head sound
      like?
    playerChoices:
    - It just sounds like thoughts
    - Idk. You're weird
    - Chaos and fairies
    - 'I just have an inner monologue '
    choicePoints: 01000000000000000200000001000000
    girlResponses:
    - Nothing else? Thats soooooo boooooring!
    - Whatever
    - Thats what mine sounds like too. Too many thoughts being had
    - That's interesting. I wish i could hear what it sounds like
